rSaVt5pvPk</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>A Quiet Place: Day One</em><br />(In theaters June 28th)<br /><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YPY7J-flzE8\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YPY7J-flzE8</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>Maxxxine</em><br />(In theaters July 5th)<br /><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y0uS3t6nFgY\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y0uS3t6nFgY</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>Twisters</em><br />(In theaters July 19th)<br /><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wdok0rZdmx4\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wdok0rZdmx4</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>Trap</em><br />(In theaters August 9th)<br /><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hJiPAJKjUVg\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hJiPAJKjUVg</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Episode Credits:</strong><br />Hosted by Isabella Robinson featuring Abi Linton<br />Produced by WMNJ &amp; Isabella Robinson<br />Show Artwork by Isabella Robinson<br />Special Thanks to WMNJ board, Professor Blatter, and the Robinson Family</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Theme Music: Take Your Girlie to the Movies (If You Can’t Make Love At Home) from the Library of Congress - Composed by Pete Wendling and Sung by Billy Murray: <a href=\"https://www.loc.gov/item/jukebox-33050/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.loc.gov/item/jukebox-33050/</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>Subscribe to this podcast and leave a review on Spotify, Apple Podcasts, or wherever you get podcasts! Discover more <a href=\"https://www.wmnjradio.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">WMNJ</a> and <a href=\"https://duparchive.org/\" rel=\"nofollow\">DUPA</a> content at <a href=\"https://www.wmnjradio.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">wmnjradio.com</a> and <a href=\"https://duparchive.org/\" rel=\"nofollow\">duparchive.org</a>!</em></p>\n","language":"eng","licenseurl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.7.0","subject":["Motion Picture Matchmaker","dupa_audio","dupa_podcast","WMNJ"],"title":"Motion Picture Mat